> User Macava26 (286267)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"484d6831824f2b19a891519257e8bf1a","RawContent":"Hi all!! I just returned last week from my destination wedding at Now Larimar. The location and size of resort was perfect for our 40 guests. Parents, relatives, and family friends stayed on the Now side and our friends stayed at Secrets. It was easy to find people in our group and not a hike between the two. However, Now recently added another \"wing\" to it&#039;s resort and this is not on the beach or in close walking distance to the main two locations. Keep an eye on this at check in. Service and entertainment at both resorts is outstanding, especially the butler Steves. Employees made a genuine effort to know our group and take care of us. Silvia Luna was our coordinator and she did a great job. We brought a ton of decorations with us to save money and her team worked their magic with pulling it all together. Flower bouquets were stunning and the spa was outstanding with hair and makeup for my bridesmaids and me. We planned a rehearsal dinner at Capers which worked out well the night before. You have to ask the wedding coordinator to arrange this and can only include 25 people max. Ceremony was at the Now Larimar fountain and reception on the beach in front of castaways. I felt that the resort kept both locations private enough for our event and couldn&#039;t be happier with the setup and decoration. For dinner, we went with steak and lobster from the platinum menu, which was excellent. Only issue I heard was that the beach was too dark at dinner to see the plate. The best part of the entire wedding was having Katya Nova as our photographer. She is a very special person with a lovely talent and I&#039;m fortunate to have crossed paths with her. She made our wedding magical and I love her so much!!! Lastly, be very cautious of the outside vendors that the resort works with as part of the wedding packages i.e. DJ, MC, photography\/ videography. You must communicate rather directly to get what&#039;s expected or else you will be disappointed. All of our guests commented it was the best vacation they have been on and most beautiful wedding!! It was an amazing experience!! Happy to answer any more questions you have!! Lindsay","Attachments":[],"Id":1745030,"PostDate":1365876600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all!! I just returned last week from my destination wedding at Now Larimar. The location and size of resort was perfect for our 40 guests. Parents, relatives, and family friends stayed on the Now side and our friends stayed at Secrets. It was easy to find people in our group and not a hike between the two. However, Now recently added another \"wing\" to it's resort and this is not on the beach or in close walking distance to the main two locations. Keep an eye on this at check in. Service and entertainment at both resorts is outstanding, especially the butler Steves. Employees made a genuine effort to know our group and take care of us. Silvia Luna was our coordinator and she did a great job. We brought a ton of decorations with us to save money and her team worked their magic with pulling it all together. Flower bouquets were stunning and the spa was outstanding with hair and makeup for my bridesmaids and me. We planned a rehearsal dinner at Capers which worked out well the night before. You have to ask the wedding coordinator to arrange this and can only include 25 people max. Ceremony was at the Now Larimar fountain and reception on the beach in front of castaways. I felt that the resort kept both locations private enough for our event and couldn't be happier with the setup and decoration. For dinner, we went with steak and lobster from the platinum menu, which was excellent. Only issue I heard was that the beach was too dark at dinner to see the plate. The best part of the entire wedding was having Katya Nova as our photographer. She is a very special person with a lovely talent and I'm fortunate to have crossed paths with her. She made our wedding magical and I love her so much!!! Lastly, be very cautious of the outside vendors that the resort works with as part of the wedding packages i.e. DJ, MC, photography\/ videography. You must communicate rather directly to get what's expected or else you will be disappointed. All of our guests commented it was the best vacation they have been on and most beautiful wedding!! It was an amazing experience!! Happy to answer any more questions you have!! Lindsay\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lwozniak888@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365874724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268529.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lwozniak888","Id":268529,"Name":"lwozniak888","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"994cc5225d96cf7072a0c2eabc24ca35","RawContent":"We got our confirmation back! However they gave us 5 pm and I was wanting 4pm. I may email and request a change. The confirmation did not include locations tho. We will see. Hope you get more rooms!! Are you staying for a week or more? Also, do you have any guests staying at Secrets?","Attachments":[],"Id":1745058,"PostDate":1365893443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We got our confirmation back! However they gave us 5 pm and I was wanting 4pm. I may email and request a change. The confirmation did not include locations tho. We will see. Hope you get more rooms!! Are you staying for a week or more? Also, do you have any guests staying at Secrets?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357867978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe0ed11e13a036745ac9992f3f9e0b77","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on the confirmation, we also just got comfirmation we can have the preffered rooms we asked for, No guest staying Secrets, Some might have to our guest list seems to keep getting bigger. Some of our guests are staying for 2 weeks, Myself and fiance have not decided yet. Who did you get as your weding coordinator? We were asigned Silvia and I emailed her last week to see what the had for decor on hand, colour wise. Im trying to bring as little as possible from home.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1745444,"PostDate":1366044384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on the confirmation, we also just got comfirmation we can have the preffered rooms we asked for, No guest staying Secrets, Some might have to our guest list seems to keep getting bigger. Some of our guests are staying for 2 weeks, Myself and fiance have not decided yet. Who did you get as your weding coordinator? We were asigned Silvia and I emailed her last week to see what the had for decor on hand, colour wise. Im trying to bring as little as possible from home.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.kemp@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365704804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268451.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda15012014","Id":268451,"Name":"amanda15012014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64a836301ba92b9ab585e4c70803e759","RawContent":"Congrats on getting your rooms! We nights have some guests stay on the Secrets side because they want the adults only. So far, my fianc\u00a9 and I are the only ones staying two weeks. We also got Silvia as a wedding coordinator. Hopefully communication is easy! I think they&#039;re pretty busy. Let me know how it goes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1745766,"PostDate":1366132199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats on getting your rooms! We nights have some guests stay on the Secrets side because they want the adults only. So far, my fianc\u00a9 and I are the only ones staying two weeks. We also got Silvia as a wedding coordinator. Hopefully communication is easy! I think they're pretty busy. Let me know how it goes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357867978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b7e5a7efe92cb0628b49dbe14a156601","RawContent":"@amanda15012014 We have Jan 28 booked, well we are still waiting on the confirmation from the resort. On those request forms I did include location for ceremony and reception. Did you book yours yet?","Attachments":[],"Id":1746240,"PostDate":1365785148,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @amanda15012014 We have Jan 28 booked, well we are still waiting on the confirmation from the resort. On those request forms I did include location for ceremony and reception. Did you book yours yet?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357867978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d38a21fcaa6ec6faabe1c23c6657b76f","RawContent":"We got confirmation last week but I didn&#039;t include locations on that page cause we weren&#039;t sure. I emailed a request for the eclipse terrace and pool side reception today so we will see, I&#039;ve been waiting almost a week now to hear if they can find more preferred rooms for our reservation so we will see.","Attachments":[],"Id":1746301,"PostDate":1365791295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We got confirmation last week but I didn't include locations on that page cause we weren't sure. I emailed a request for the eclipse terrace and pool side reception today so we will see, I've been waiting almost a week now to hear if they can find more preferred rooms for our reservation so we will see.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.kemp@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365704804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268451.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda15012014","Id":268451,"Name":"amanda15012014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"143f5950dea9eed10054743aa0488401","RawContent":"Hi all!! I just returned last week from my destination wedding at Now Larimar. The location and size of resort was perfect for our 40 guests. Parents, relatives, and family friends stayed on the Now side and our friends stayed at Secrets. It was easy to find people in our group and not a hike between the two. However, Now recently added another \"wing\" to it&#039;s resort and this is not on the beach or in close walking distance to the main two locations. Keep an eye on this at check in. Service and entertainment at both resorts is outstanding, especially the butler Steves. Employees made a genuine effort to know our group and take care of us. Silvia Luna was our coordinator and she did a great job. We brought a ton of decorations with us to save money and her team worked their magic with pulling it all together. Flower bouquets were stunning and the spa was outstanding with hair and makeup for my bridesmaids and me. We planned a rehearsal dinner at Capers which worked out well the night before. You have to ask the wedding coordinator to arrange this and can only include 25 people max. Ceremony was at the Now Larimar fountain and reception on the beach in front of castaways. I felt that the resort kept both locations private enough for our event and couldn&#039;t be happier with the setup and decoration. For dinner, we went with steak and lobster from the platinum menu, which was excellent. Only issue I heard was that the beach was too dark at dinner to see the plate. The best part of the entire wedding was having Katya Nova as our photographer. She is a very special person with a lovely talent and I&#039;m fortunate to have crossed paths with her. She made our wedding magical and I love her so much!!! Lastly, be very cautious of the outside vendors that the resort works with as part of the wedding packages i.e. DJ, MC, photography\/ videography. You must communicate rather directly to get what&#039;s expected or else you will be disappointed. All of our guests commented it was the best vacation they have been on and most beautiful wedding!! It was an amazing experience!! Happy to answer any more questions you have!! Lindsay","Attachments":[],"Id":1746530,"PostDate":1365876600,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all!! I just returned last week from my destination wedding at Now Larimar. The location and size of resort was perfect for our 40 guests. Parents, relatives, and family friends stayed on the Now side and our friends stayed at Secrets. It was easy to find people in our group and not a hike between the two. However, Now recently added another \"wing\" to it's resort and this is not on the beach or in close walking distance to the main two locations. Keep an eye on this at check in. Service and entertainment at both resorts is outstanding, especially the butler Steves. Employees made a genuine effort to know our group and take care of us. Silvia Luna was our coordinator and she did a great job. We brought a ton of decorations with us to save money and her team worked their magic with pulling it all together. Flower bouquets were stunning and the spa was outstanding with hair and makeup for my bridesmaids and me. We planned a rehearsal dinner at Capers which worked out well the night before. You have to ask the wedding coordinator to arrange this and can only include 25 people max. Ceremony was at the Now Larimar fountain and reception on the beach in front of castaways. I felt that the resort kept both locations private enough for our event and couldn't be happier with the setup and decoration. For dinner, we went with steak and lobster from the platinum menu, which was excellent. Only issue I heard was that the beach was too dark at dinner to see the plate. The best part of the entire wedding was having Katya Nova as our photographer. She is a very special person with a lovely talent and I'm fortunate to have crossed paths with her. She made our wedding magical and I love her so much!!! Lastly, be very cautious of the outside vendors that the resort works with as part of the wedding packages i.e. DJ, MC, photography\/ videography. You must communicate rather directly to get what's expected or else you will be disappointed. All of our guests commented it was the best vacation they have been on and most beautiful wedding!! It was an amazing experience!! Happy to answer any more questions you have!! Lindsay\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lwozniak888@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365874724,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268529.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lwozniak888","Id":268529,"Name":"lwozniak888","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3464ba6eccaf5176c6c27d02dfa6248","RawContent":"We got our confirmation back! However they gave us 5 pm and I was wanting 4pm. I may email and request a change. The confirmation did not include locations tho. We will see. Hope you get more rooms!! Are you staying for a week or more? Also, do you have any guests staying at Secrets?","Attachments":[],"Id":1746558,"PostDate":1365893443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We got our confirmation back! However they gave us 5 pm and I was wanting 4pm. I may email and request a change. The confirmation did not include locations tho. We will see. Hope you get more rooms!! Are you staying for a week or more? Also, do you have any guests staying at Secrets?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357867978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5364bb22243e134699bdf74c3caf5914","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congrats on the confirmation, we also just got comfirmation we can have the preffered rooms we asked for, No guest staying Secrets, Some might have to our guest list seems to keep getting bigger. Some of our guests are staying for 2 weeks, Myself and fiance have not decided yet. Who did you get as your weding coordinator? We were asigned Silvia and I emailed her last week to see what the had for decor on hand, colour wise. Im trying to bring as little as possible from home.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1746944,"PostDate":1366044384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congrats on the confirmation, we also just got comfirmation we can have the preffered rooms we asked for, No guest staying Secrets, Some might have to our guest list seems to keep getting bigger. Some of our guests are staying for 2 weeks, Myself and fiance have not decided yet. Who did you get as your weding coordinator? We were asigned Silvia and I emailed her last week to see what the had for decor on hand, colour wise. Im trying to bring as little as possible from home.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amanda.kemp@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1365704804,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-268451.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amanda15012014","Id":268451,"Name":"amanda15012014","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":72826,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fbf60d8554750cacccb49bd4ed49d918","RawContent":"Congrats on getting your rooms! We nights have some guests stay on the Secrets side because they want the adults only. So far, my fianc\u00a9 and I are the only ones staying two weeks. We also got Silvia as a wedding coordinator. Hopefully communication is easy! I think they&#039;re pretty busy. Let me know how it goes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1747266,"PostDate":1366132199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats on getting your rooms! We nights have some guests stay on the Secrets side because they want the adults only. So far, my fianc\u00a9 and I are the only ones staying two weeks. We also got Silvia as a wedding coordinator. Hopefully communication is easy! I think they're pretty busy. Let me know how it goes.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinasimms@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.150.70.86","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1357867978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-264243.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Kristina Simms","Id":264243,"Name":"Kristina Simms","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":464,"TotalPages":47,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":460},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
